<title>USA: IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE NOT WELL TESTED, WEAK -USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE NOT WELL TESTED, WEAK -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers on a live basis were not well tested, with a lower undertone noted, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said. Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 66.00.</p>
<p>Carcass basis Steers and heifers not well tested. Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100 lbs ld 105.50. Reported sales for Wed - 100 Week to Date - 6,300</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
